WEBVTT

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:33.460
I'm a monster.

00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:37.470
I'm sick of you butting in every time I try and make friends.

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:39.470
From now on, just stay away.

00:00:39.470 --> 00:00:40.530
What's the matter?

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:53.130
Did someone go off and leave you two?

00:00:53.130 --> 00:00:56.130
Are you all alone, boy, just like me?

00:00:56.130 --> 00:00:58.650
See, that's great.

00:00:58.650 --> 00:01:00.000
We can be alone together.

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:05.860
That's right, boy. We're gonna have lots of fun, aren't we?

00:01:05.860 --> 00:01:11.210
He's not from this world, the one you and I live in. He's only here to fulfill his destiny.

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:14.320
What's a Momodo? Let's start there.

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:18.820
I'm sure, now that you understand, you'll be relieved to hand over your book.

00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:23.160
If I hand over the book and it's destroyed, goodbye, Zatch.

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:27.510
I can't move my arms or anything.

00:01:27.510 --> 00:01:30.000
However hard it may be, believe me, you're better off with me.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.390
so either you hand over that book of yours or I'll tear it out of your hands

00:01:35.390 --> 00:01:41.230
myself you won't stand in my way they'll keep coming for the battle has begun

00:01:41.230 --> 00:01:50.740
hey what are you doing here this is Kyo's house you can't come in here

00:02:09.050 --> 00:02:23.730
- Modo.

00:02:23.730 --> 00:02:25.160
- Modo, isn't it?

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:26.780
- Yes.

00:02:26.780 --> 00:02:28.870
I sensed their presence earlier.

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:38.410
what now well it's fine for us if they beat each other up let's see how things turn out for now

00:02:39.070 --> 00:02:52.040
then we'll decide what to do with the winner doggie want a biscuit remember me i'm your friend from

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:59.030
before

00:03:38.540 --> 00:03:44.730
down keo why did i come down to save you from being attacked by that thing he's not a thing

00:03:44.730 --> 00:03:56.150
he's my friend and he'd never do anything to hurt me what your friend

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:02.860
- If he's your friend, I'd hate to see your enemies.

00:04:02.860 --> 00:04:05.180
So go over there and have a nice chat with your friend

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:08.160
and make sure he knows that I'm your friend too.

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:10.530
- The book, there it is.

00:04:10.530 --> 00:04:12.670
Burn his book, Renji, quickly

00:04:12.670 --> 00:04:15.870
before they can try a counter-attack.

00:04:15.870 --> 00:04:18.150
- Relax, these two are not as strong

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:20.480
as you originally thought they were, Gophore.

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:22.260
You know, the only reason I went along with you

00:04:22.260 --> 00:04:23.940
on this battle was because you told me

00:04:23.940 --> 00:04:25.700
it would be a cool challenge.

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:27.370
Boy, were you wrong.

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:30.000
These guys are nothing but a couple of weaklings.

00:04:34.860 --> 00:04:36.860
So we might as well have some fun.

00:04:36.860 --> 00:04:41.840
We can always burn their book after we're done toying with them, right?

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:43.010
They'll keep coming.

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:44.780
For the battle has begun.

00:04:44.780 --> 00:04:49.950
I can't believe the battle for the Momoto King is actually happening right here in my house!

00:04:49.950 --> 00:04:53.430
He wants to take my book!

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:59.120
The reason he pretended to be like me is not my friend either.

00:05:07.290 --> 00:05:09.950
Well let's get started with an oldie but a goodie.

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:19.200
What are you doing? Hurry up and run!

00:05:30.090 --> 00:05:35.850
you doing snap out of it let's get out of here zatch no you're the one who should run away keo

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:40.330
after all you said i was nothing but trouble so what would you want to hang around me for what

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:46.580
i only said that because you were tooting your horn to everyone about spewing lightning

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:51.620
what's wrong with that huh if i'm good at stuff why shouldn't i be able to tell everyone i just

00:05:51.620 --> 00:06:00.000
wanted to make one real friend that's all even though i'm just a monster count i'd be proud of some

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:01.720
Is it something I'm good at in my monster way?

00:06:02.910 --> 00:06:04.310
What's wrong with that?

00:06:06.020 --> 00:06:07.620
What's wrong with that, huh?

00:06:12.130 --> 00:06:15.990
Oh man, the poor kid has suffered so much on his own.

00:06:15.990 --> 00:06:19.590
And I just make it worse with all my stupid insults.

00:06:36.460 --> 00:06:38.390
with the laid-back attitude, chumps!

00:06:38.390 --> 00:06:41.410
Are you guys finished after only one little lightning attack?

00:06:41.410 --> 00:06:44.320
Oh, no!

00:06:44.320 --> 00:06:46.320
Zatch, move!

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:50.710
Kyo!

00:06:50.710 --> 00:07:00.000
Up in front, my body's stronger than yours!

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:01.400
Kyo!

00:07:02.110 --> 00:07:04.010
What kind of friend am I?

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:05.360
Kyo!

00:07:05.890 --> 00:07:07.490
No matter how I treat him,

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:09.690
Zatch always helps me.

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:12.230
But I never do anything to help him.

00:07:12.470 --> 00:07:15.030
I just find ways to make him feel bad.

00:07:17.930 --> 00:07:20.930
Finished already?

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:22.110
Boring.

00:07:22.360 --> 00:07:25.220
And I was thinking I might actually have some fun today.

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:30.000
The roost!

00:07:33.870 --> 00:07:37.030
I think it's time for us to put an end to this silly game.

00:07:37.030 --> 00:07:38.680
Huh?

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:11.080
Not Gophooray.

00:08:11.580 --> 00:08:13.560
I haven't finished with him yet.

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:19.190
Useless pup killed me.

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:26.750
Can get out.

00:08:37.520 --> 00:08:39.480
"Now it's time to deal with you."

00:08:39.480 --> 00:08:44.460
"Avi-Rae."

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:49.610
"I've allowed you the ability to move your hand."

00:08:49.610 --> 00:08:55.800
"So if you don't want to be crushed by the force of gravity pressing down on you then hand the book over to me right now."

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:57.250
"No way."

00:08:57.250 --> 00:08:58.660
"Never."

00:08:58.660 --> 00:09:00.000
"Fine."

00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:14.720
I'm just a monster, you said it yourself.

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:17.500
So stop trying to take care of me.

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:20.100
All I do is bring you trouble.

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:22.400
Give them the book and I'll leave you alone.

00:09:22.400 --> 00:09:24.540
I'm gonna go away from here.

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:26.420
So I won't bring you any more trouble

00:09:26.420 --> 00:09:28.330
and you can finally be safe.

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:30.000
'Cause I don't.

00:09:33.230 --> 00:09:34.710
Why can't I stick around now?

00:09:34.710 --> 00:09:35.930
That's it!

00:09:35.930 --> 00:09:36.890
You!

00:09:36.890 --> 00:09:38.780
Don't even like me!

00:09:38.780 --> 00:09:41.760
Then it's best if I just go!

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:44.820
Now, just let go of the book.

00:09:44.820 --> 00:09:45.920
Okay?

00:09:45.920 --> 00:09:47.230
Please?

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:49.950
That's it!

00:09:49.950 --> 00:09:52.100
Ah!

00:09:52.100 --> 00:09:53.550
Okay.

00:09:53.550 --> 00:09:54.960
I hear ya.

00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:56.860
Loud and clear, buddy.

00:09:56.860 --> 00:09:59.060
I'm sorry that I said that stuff about you.

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:10.320
you don't bring me trouble you helped me now it's my turn to help you there's too much to thank you

00:10:10.320 --> 00:10:21.290
for i can't repay you for all the little things you've done for me since we met try i'll try to

00:10:21.290 --> 00:10:30.000
pay you back for everything you've given me this time i'm going to do everything in my power to help you

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:38.300
No matter what they do to me now, this time I'm not letting you down, Zatch!

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:41.680
No one's ever been able to resist this long before.

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:44.820
Even with all this pressure I'm forcing down on him.

00:10:44.820 --> 00:10:48.120
He shouldn't even be able to lift one little finger!

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:50.650
Especially since he's been so badly hurt.

00:10:50.650 --> 00:10:54.650
But he seems to be gaining strength, why won't he let go of the book?

00:10:54.650 --> 00:10:57.400
How can he possibly have enough strength to stand up?

00:11:08.220 --> 00:11:10.040
I'm tired of your little games.

00:11:10.040 --> 00:11:15.920
Gravi-ray!

00:11:15.920 --> 00:11:21.860
Still moving, even at this level.

00:11:21.860 --> 00:11:26.380
I don't know what your problem was before all this started.

00:11:26.380 --> 00:11:28.840
Compared to yours?

00:11:30.990 --> 00:11:34.290
- My problems might not seem like all that much.

00:11:37.040 --> 00:11:41.080
But for me, they were pretty big.

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:45.810
I didn't have any friends because of the way I used to act.

00:11:47.360 --> 00:11:50.600
But thanks to Zatch, that's starting to change.

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:54.060
He helped me see who I really am, who I can become.

00:11:55.650 --> 00:11:58.130
What about you?

00:11:58.130 --> 00:12:00.000
I'll bet you have your own problems.

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:02.430
And maybe this guy is your way of solving them.

00:12:02.770 --> 00:12:05.390
So you can understand why I'll never let Satch down.

00:12:06.230 --> 00:12:06.990
That's why.

00:12:07.360 --> 00:12:08.340
That's why.

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:10.360
I'll never give you.

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:14.290
This.

00:12:14.800 --> 00:12:15.280
Book.

00:12:17.300 --> 00:12:17.940
Ray!

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:21.670
Ah!

00:12:45.800 --> 00:12:47.770
won't be able to stand. I guess

00:12:47.770 --> 00:12:49.830
you forgot what it was like for you in the Momodo

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:51.840
world. But I remember clearly

00:12:51.840 --> 00:12:54.230
what you were like. And nothing's

00:12:54.230 --> 00:12:55.930
changed. You were a weakling then

00:12:55.930 --> 00:12:57.930
and you're a weakling now.

00:12:58.420 --> 00:13:00.000
It's uncanny that you're even

00:13:00.030 --> 00:13:04.530
You've been able to find a human partner as pathetic as you to team up with in battle here.

00:13:04.530 --> 00:13:08.170
I don't know why you were even chosen to be in this battle at all.

00:13:08.170 --> 00:13:12.670
Do you think making friends with a human like this will win you the crown, you fool?

00:13:12.670 --> 00:13:16.990
Don't make me laugh.

00:13:16.990 --> 00:13:20.420
You're all alone in both worlds.

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:26.790
I told you to leave my friend alone!

00:13:31.980 --> 00:13:33.480
How can he take this much?

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:35.470
He-he stood up!

00:13:35.470 --> 00:13:36.670
Kiyo?

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:43.220
Kiyo?

00:13:43.220 --> 00:13:44.750
You're...

00:13:44.750 --> 00:13:45.860
You're...

00:13:45.860 --> 00:13:47.830
You're not alone!

00:13:47.830 --> 00:13:49.350
Fight, Satch!

00:13:49.350 --> 00:13:50.780
Fight!

00:13:50.780 --> 00:13:56.930
It's not just for this stupid contest to decide who becomes king, but do it for us!

00:13:56.930 --> 00:13:58.480
Show 'em you're not alone!

00:14:00.670 --> 00:14:07.870
you'll find your destiny work with me if you want to find out who you really are

00:14:07.870 --> 00:14:14.500
deep inside then fight for it with everything you've got and I'll stand by

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:26.090
you both of us together I'll fight with you because you are my friend Satch it

00:14:26.090 --> 00:14:30.000
doesn't matter if you're a Momodo or a monster you're my friend

00:14:31.050 --> 00:14:33.670
- No excuses like you don't want to get me into trouble.

00:14:33.670 --> 00:14:34.890
Now fight!

00:14:57.020 --> 00:14:58.180
- Determined to battle.

00:14:58.180 --> 00:14:58.870
- Yes.

00:15:00.030 --> 00:15:02.430
That's it then, no more mercy.

00:15:02.430 --> 00:15:04.750
I'm canceling the Gravire spell.

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:08.920
And then, we'll slam them with the biggest spell we have.

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:12.650
Are you absolutely sure that's such a good idea, Sherry?

00:15:12.650 --> 00:15:21.390
Even if they can defeat this attack, they'll just get destroyed by the other teams, so either way, it's going to be the end for someone.

00:15:21.390 --> 00:15:25.160
So, the end is here.

00:15:48.330 --> 00:15:49.330
Longer than before.

00:15:49.330 --> 00:15:51.640
I've never seen anything so intense.

00:15:51.640 --> 00:15:54.770
Are you ready to fight, Zatch?

00:15:54.770 --> 00:15:55.670
Yeah!

00:15:55.670 --> 00:15:59.800
Friends, right?

00:16:03.550 --> 00:16:18.630
Gather an incredible amount of energy!

00:16:18.630 --> 00:16:19.700
It can't be.

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:21.530
It can't be!

00:16:21.530 --> 00:16:26.080
No one can counter this attack!

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:29.030
Nothing is as powerful as the Gagano Rey spell!

00:16:31.880 --> 00:16:51.310
the red book won't give it up no matter what you say or do i'll never hand it over no matter how

00:16:51.310 --> 00:17:00.000
many times you attack us you'll be defeated just like today by us together

00:17:00.060 --> 00:17:15.670
if you were going to pass out you should have done it sooner and spared yourself all that pain

00:17:15.670 --> 00:17:25.280
help me see who i really am and who i can become because you are my friend zatch

00:17:34.120 --> 00:17:51.440
it's okay he just passed out when he regains consciousness tell him this this time we'll let

00:17:51.440 --> 00:17:57.610
you go but we'll definitely be back for the book again until that time comes take care of that book

00:17:57.610 --> 00:18:00.000
and don't lose understand

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:03.620
We won't forgive you if you lose to someone other than us.

00:18:04.820 --> 00:18:05.940
We shall meet again.

00:18:06.650 --> 00:18:08.350
Momodo of the Red Book.

00:18:12.960 --> 00:18:18.650
Why didn't you just let him go?

00:18:19.210 --> 00:18:21.120
Defeating them simply wasn't necessary.

00:18:21.380 --> 00:18:23.300
We'll have another chance, I guarantee you.

00:18:23.880 --> 00:18:26.480
Something on your mind?

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:28.600
Not really. Nothing in particular.

00:18:29.200 --> 00:18:30.000
It's just...

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:32.650
You look... different than usual.

00:18:32.650 --> 00:18:37.630
You actually look happy.

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:43.380
Now then, Brago, after we rest up a bit, we're going to search for the next book.

00:18:43.380 --> 00:18:45.030
I don't need a rest.

00:18:45.030 --> 00:18:53.530
Don't lump me in with you humans who get tired all the time.

00:18:53.530 --> 00:18:58.560
Dear Dad, thanks to you, I seem to have gotten myself into quite a mess.

00:18:58.560 --> 00:19:00.000
But I'm not complaining.

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:04.020
might actually be the best thing that's ever happened to me of course personal

00:19:04.020 --> 00:19:18.980
growth is not without its price let's just call it growing pains but sometime

00:19:18.980 --> 00:19:22.440
we really got to sit down and talk about these birthday presents you send me

00:19:22.440 --> 00:19:30.000
the meaning of this explain yourself uh it's because well you could make me feel sorry for you by

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:32.050
Dressing up like a mummy?

00:19:32.050 --> 00:19:34.990
Joe's not faking, those are real bandages.

00:19:34.990 --> 00:19:36.030
Satch, I'll handle this.

00:19:36.030 --> 00:19:38.130
So you're going to handle me now, huh?

00:19:39.130 --> 00:19:40.050
Kyo?

00:19:40.050 --> 00:19:41.080
Are you okay?

00:19:41.080 --> 00:19:43.910
Oh, so this is part of the Act 2, I suppose.

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:49.350
But the good news is, Dad, for the first time, I have a friend to stand beside me.

00:19:49.350 --> 00:19:50.420
Satch Bell.

00:20:33.260 --> 00:20:39.260
On the next Zatch Bell, Chiyo has to go to the hospital, so I bring him some yummy fruit!

00:20:39.260 --> 00:20:41.260
But Zatch's magic red book gets lost!

00:20:41.260 --> 00:20:44.260
And if we don't find it, I'll be sent back to the Momodo world!

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:46.100
What about all that scrumptious fruit?

00:20:46.100 --> 00:20:48.880
Suzy, finding that book is more important!

00:20:48.880 --> 00:20:52.760
What could be more important than all the vitamins and minerals in Chiyo?

00:20:52.760 --> 00:20:55.020
How about saving Zatch?

00:20:55.020 --> 00:20:57.080
Zatch is in danger? Chiyo, we've got to--

00:20:57.080 --> 00:20:59.750
We will, next week on...

00:21:00.280 --> 00:21:00.960
Bell!
